{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_title", "source_sha256": "eab75628d3728431fd548d953fa044c54ea01e7485698264f64d57f4e208a972", "ja": "「君と出会ってから」菊地真", "zh": "“自从与你相遇” 菊地真", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b5bbec1484d4111fbdfa1239539a6012006f924922eab4ae83ef4cd39c777419", "ja": "Destiny公演を前に、\n真とプロデューサーが出会った頃からの\nことを振り返る一幕です。", "zh": "在Destiny公演前，\n回顾真与制作人相遇至今\n种种过往的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6dca70f81ca73c7a65e976c1e4b27104db559670b693af2933c8dcb8cc094aba", "ja": "（公演準備で忙しい中、どうにかねじ込んでいた\n真の仕事が、直前でドタキャンされてしまった……）", "zh": "（在忙于公演准备的时候，好不容易塞进日程安排的真那份工作，却在临近时被临时取消了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1001_p", "source_sha256": "82aa28a4132e732bfe0ec6a403b694c910c8711436d0545118bcc4cd9fb20366", "ja": "悪いな、せっかく事務所まで来てもらったのに。", "zh": "抱歉，难得请你特意跑一趟事务所。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "de84f55289af236f17a370b2da593e96277d7c915d995d4edc54c03f10730ce0", "ja": "あはは、仕方ないですよ。\n先方の都合ですからね。", "zh": "啊哈哈，这也是没办法的事嘛。\n毕竟是对方那边有情况嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "1d937ec4dc8015119e3a1745acd9a8167d3d1e117999e4a3de60e63df32b5be4", "ja": "ボクなら大丈夫です、こっちに来たついでに、\nジムに寄って帰ります！", "zh": "我没关系的，正好都来这边了，我去趟健身房再回去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d10719f9f266972ae21ea2d3f2dfc08f2f9f9f2a3a365bf51e38ef80940afa36", "ja": "ジムか……。ずっと忙しいんだし、\nこの際、体を休めた方がいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "去健身房啊……你一直都这么忙，趁这个机会，还是好好休息一下身体比较好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "9ebde10b9fcb952a78947f99a9e138a5abc588dbed1938ac3cf1aa1e3e415d64", "ja": "平気ですって。まだまだ余力はありますからね♪\n公演も近いし、ガツンと気合い入れて行きますよ！", "zh": "没事的啦。我还有的是精力呢♪\n而且公演也快到了，我得鼓足干劲冲一把才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "2c0cf7d96be15947662227e3cb32ca0c1bd0e279d267749ddebc4d3220c88181", "ja": "それに、最近新しいマシンが入ったみたいで。\nちょっと試してみたいんですよね～。", "zh": "而且，最近好像还添置了新的器械。\n我想稍微试试看呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1007_p", "source_sha256": "dabab2cc00018561a23e19ba7a9a04ecfe2412628b706d442120602ec2b41134", "ja": "はは、なるほど。まぁ、真はそうやって、\nずっと体を動かしてたほうがいいのかもな。", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此。嗯，真或许还是一直活动活动身体比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c681edf40db1eecc9dd9db74b329aa936073b409961f94a312b4587a96d6e616", "ja": "そういえば、真を担当することになった時も、\nジムに迎えに行ったっけ……。", "zh": "说起来，负责真那会儿，我也是去健身房接她的来着……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "19114c4e56ce2bb42cb0731406b40bd64d20c0960824bbbbb80f5c8a61deb931", "ja": "「ええええっ、じゃあ、ボク、\nついにデビューできるんですかっ。やーりぃ！」", "zh": "“诶诶诶诶？那我终于要出道了吗？太棒啦！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "607990f87066ee4a2fdf44ab5d6baad3e1e93bc9646a853a93c9b3e9e03d9e65", "ja": "あ、そうでしたね。\nあはは、なんか懐かしいな！", "zh": "啊，对了，确实是这样。\n啊哈哈，总觉得好怀念啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "ec2148e221ede754a714df8780036d33e7350ff40386c61a283932d4556dd552", "ja": "でも、ジム通いの成果は出てると思いますよ。\n体力もついたし、ダンスのキレも良くなりましたよね？", "zh": "不过，我觉得你坚持去健身房还是有成果的。\n体力也变好了，舞蹈动作也更利落了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1e04e868aab6265978147ffe117f32c212e2e92dcad4b29fa7337fba24a8c8e9", "ja": "もちろん。スタミナも動きの切れ味も、あの頃とは\n全然違う。表現の幅も広がってるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "当然。无论是体力还是动作的利落程度，都和那时候完全不同了。表现力的范围应该也拓宽了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "e0d07f5aa11102fee3109ff47b309ac677c3f2c662dc3e00d5512fba27e7ad89", "ja": "ですよね～！\nじつは自分でも、成長した気がするんですよ！", "zh": "就是嘛～！\n其实我自己也觉得，自己好像成长了不少呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8b3ab3054d4b7730596bf8e0d2dd839f305835fe2a7666e056bf7aa692d39887", "ja": "それに、真本来のりりしさも可愛さも、こう……\n自然体でスッと出せるようになったと思う。", "zh": "而且，真本来的英姿与可爱，也能这样……自然而然地展现出来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "eead19cc0025cc659ec6e7fb6da50904de28938c0496b9329308cce3e03ee42b", "ja": "えっ！？　それは……つまり……\nボクが、かわいく……なった、とか？", "zh": "诶！？那就是说……也就是说……\n我变得……可爱了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1016_p", "source_sha256": "0ba57d38718479aa64228e702665010b8dcc14ea142c62a1f5e5d4cd6727c79f", "ja": "うん、可愛くなったよ。\nもともと可愛かったけど、さらに可愛くなったぞ！", "zh": "嗯，变得更可爱了哦。\n虽然本来就很可爱，但现在更可爱了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "fcd0fec7d342b8dea15370668608258ae54aa2e51d91c926407dfd6963d495cb", "ja": "うわぁ、やめてください！　いやあの、うれしいんです\nけど、そうハッキリいわれると、どうしていいか……！", "zh": "哇啊，请别这样啦！不对那个，虽然我也很高兴，\n但被这么直白地夸奖，我都不知道该怎么办才好了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "b756d9012682995db6084912cf060fa164694f5b57933d804109a3c0b13c3d72", "ja": "よし、ジムに行こう。\nとりあえず、無心で運動してきます！", "zh": "好，去健身房吧。\n总之，先什么都不想，好好运动一番！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1019_p", "source_sha256": "757bb4a791a099a27d925c8ede4e65468823a5e2c85d50bed8fac57fec2e1d4f", "ja": "そ、そうか。いいけど、真はアイドルなんだから、\nもっと褒められることに慣れたほうがいいぞ？", "zh": "这、这样啊。虽然没问题，不过真可是偶像，还是应该习惯被人夸奖才好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "76b31468b92d04e3aec5cb9ff958b210142eacf47d6b3475004c2fc948f0d97f", "ja": "それは、そうなんでしょうけど……\n相手によるっていうか……。あ、そうだ！", "zh": "话是这么说没错……\n但也要看对象是谁吧……啊，对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "99c744238a87bf26775a662e712f39e7efb402f75fa9e249f6aed40c145cce5a", "ja": "それじゃ{$P$}も一緒に、\nジム行きましょうよ！　予定、空いちゃいましたよね？", "zh": "那么，{$P$}也一起去健身房吧！您的安排不是空出来了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1022_p", "source_sha256": "b972aa39d47fc554ed9ddf959c7c3248ae2d8edf054dade2eb8a8141b0b2fd28", "ja": "……え？　なんでそうなるんだ？", "zh": "……诶？怎么会变成这样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1023_006mak", "source_sha256": "498eff5183b4464d4ae1ba7f728171fc1de6464c227b5aa20bded5982b0c0ae4", "ja": "だって、ボクばっかりいわれるのは不公平です。\nプロデュースにも体力は必要ですよね～？", "zh": "可是，老是只说我一个人，也太不公平了。制作工作也需要体力，对吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1024_p", "source_sha256": "865fa1ea5db0e77d4dc5214855f9ba55f8242f588901b3630d5c85d29070d7ea", "ja": "うっ、そう言われると……。\nわかった。時間も空いたし、たまには行ってみるか。", "zh": "唔，被你这么一说……\n好吧。既然正好有空，偶尔去一次也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1025_006mak", "source_sha256": "59b899b91a248b37fc6693d5697601a3dda36d4dcd7d40d3b8cb98f04e2c0a92", "ja": "へへっ、そうこなくっちゃ！　安心してください、　\nボクが最高の個人メニューを組んであげますから！", "zh": "嘿嘿，这才对嘛！请放心，  \n我会为你制定最棒的个人训练菜单！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1026_006mak", "source_sha256": "0990e13a662ed9533492a3e271491da6d4a71bbeac955a708a6208c90b82740f", "ja": "でも何がいいかなぁ。いきなり負荷が高すぎると\nケガするから、最初は軽いところで……。", "zh": "不过选什么好呢。要是一开始负荷就太高，\n会受伤的，所以最初先从轻松点的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1027_p", "source_sha256": "e24b4d730b2086be705c2813b8c8a96da8f3f1f60013487fedac48fd2aae8f4c", "ja": "（……そうだな。これからも真と一緒に、走り続ける\nために。こっちもしっかり鍛えておかないと！）", "zh": "（……是啊。为了今后也能和真一起继续跑下去。我这边也得好好锻炼才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1028_006mak", "source_sha256": "ce0f6e740540d6eda0bda29fde7b5e2c295768638c7cbadb851cb46397b08b7a", "ja": "でもバッキバキになった{$P$}も、\n見てみたいような……。", "zh": "不过，也有点想看看变得硬邦邦的{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_006mak_1029_p", "source_sha256": "04bff8ca823b333f9c06e5409f45be8baef9e53ae4881772017be375e8c2f52e", "ja": "（……そこまで？）", "zh": "（……要到那种程度吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
